      "type": "text",
      "title": "Tips",
      "text": [
        "A dark farm or a Ward Drum's killing ground both work. Players are never a Ward Drum's target, and the bell still hears every death it causes.",
        "A Listening Pit wants a steady draw, so pair the bell with a Pulse Cairn.",
        "Bells are the [Seal-carvers'](tribe_sigil) craft: the recipe needs a Bell Fragment and a Spirit Seal, and the Seal-carvers trade a bell to their Kin."
